   "w_last": "5-07.w017",
   "f0": 77,
   "f1": 430
  },
  {
   "sid": "5-07.s3",
   "text": "The results went back in, with a predicted pose of how 001 sat in the pocket.",
   "w_first": "5-07.w018",
   "w_last": "5-07.w033",
   "f0": 456,
   "f1": 815
  },
  {
   "sid": "5-07.s4",
   "text": "Sixteen new designs.",
